# Paper drafts, build artifacts and figure scripts stay out of the repo: they are
# ~3 MB of superseded revisions that would sit in every clone forever. The one
# published PDF is tracked; the drafts belong in a Zenodo deposit or a release
# asset. A `git add -A` swept them in once, so they are ignored rather than
# merely untracked.
paper/*
!paper/quantity-and-quality-standard-reporting-framework.pdf
scripts/
nul
